quarter worth of EBITDA in the fourth quarter, making the organic guide down more pronounced than the reported guide down?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/enpro-industries-npo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2019 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2020-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris O'Neal","x":"Our guidance excludes changes in the number of shares outstanding, impacts from future acquisitions, divestitures and related transaction costs, restructuring costs, the impacts of tariffs and trade tensions on market demand and costs subsequent to the end of the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2019 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"Actions we have taken this year include rightsizing our workforce, improving plant overhead and decreasing SG&A spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2019 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"The biggest drivers of our adjusted EBITDA increase were the benefits from our acquisitions of LeanTeq and The Aseptic Group, cost reduction efforts in our businesses and the exit from the brake shoe business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"In engineered products, we continue to optimize the cost structure in response to volume declines in this business and are taking actions to rightsize our workforce, improve plant overhead and decrease SG&A spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"As we've had to rightsize our business, we have implemented healthcare benefits for those employees impacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"Given the evolving macroeconomic climate and uncertainty surrounding the COVID-19 pandemic, we are withdrawing our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"The decrease was driven by sales volume declines across our businesses and $5 million in inventory writedowns related to the recently announced heavy-duty truck exits, offset in part by acquisition contributions and companywide cost-reduction programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"During the second quarter, we recorded total restructuring and impairment charges of $17.5 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q3","e":"npo","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"…was 35.2%, an increase of 250 basis points versus the prior year period, driven by the benefit of acquisitions, supply chain initiatives, companywide cost reduction programs and improved operating performance, including reduction in warranty expense, offset in part by the impact of sales decline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/enpro-industries-npo-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jerry Johnson","x":"…guidance which excludes changes in the number of shares outstanding, impacts from future acquisitions, dispositions, and related transaction costs, restructuring costs, incremental impacts of tariffs, and trade tensions on market demand and costs subsequent to the end of the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"So that we can pass on price increases immediately as we start to see them, and we've already started that process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"Gross profit margin of 37.5% increased 330 basis points versus the prior-year period driven by the benefit of divesting low-margin businesses as well as initiatives supported by the EnPro Capability Center, including supply chain and other companywide cost reduction programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2020 Q4","e":"npo","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"Improved margin was driven primarily by production in operational cost reduction initiatives and by portfolio reshaping in the segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/enpro-industries-npo-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"…and dispositions and related transaction costs, restructuring costs, incremental impacts of tariffs and trade tensions on market demand and costs subsequent to the end of the first quarter, the impact of foreign exchange rate changes subsequent to the end of the first quarter, impacts from…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"This enhanced collaboration really helped us to respond quickly with price increases to offset higher material costs and increased customer engagement where necessary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"We're also doing a great job in terms of pricing to get ahead of the commodity price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"…outstanding, impacts from future acquisitions and dispositions and related transaction costs, restructuring costs, incremental impacts of tariffs and trade tensions on market demand and costs subsequent to the end of the first quarter, the impact of foreign exchange rate changes subsequent to","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marvin Riley","x":"We delivered extraordinary results, driven by improved demand, the benefits of increased exposure to higher-margin and faster growth businesses, which resulted from portfolio actions taken last year and cost savings initiatives driven by our Capability Center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Milt Childress","x":"And it's one of the reasons why we made the decision to increase our guidance by the magnitude that we did.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/enpro-industries-npo-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"In general, customers have been accepting of price increases as everything is going up due to labor shortage and material price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"We had announced price increases July 1st in the STEMCO business that have just went in, it will affect our second half of the year favorably.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Gentile","x":"…will be providing full-year guidance, which excludes changes in the number of shares outstanding, impacts from future acquisitions, dispositions and related transaction costs, restructuring costs, raw material availability and pricing and other costs subsequent to the end of the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"Together, these factors played a role in our decision to raise our full-year guidance, which Milt will touch on in his presentation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/enpro-industries-npo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"NPO 2021 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"ma