llancourt","x":"After my update, I will turn the call over to Joe for a more detailed discussion of our results and drivers of our increased guidance for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/enpro-npo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q1","e":"npo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"Moving now to our increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/enpro-npo-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"Various market forecasts and indications from our customers suggest an acceleration of capital spending to support the need for more chip production as artificial intelligence, advanced computing and communications infrastructure take a quantum leap.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"But there's clear significant investment going on right now in leading-edge chip architecture and infrastructure for advanced AI and other computing, which is driving a lot of that build-out for equipment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"The tariff refunds, we always say were minimal and manageable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Steve Ferazani","x":"Were there any tariff refunds in the number?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"In terms of pricing power, yes, there's still pricing opportunities a little bit with AlpHa and our newer acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"Corporate expenses of $15.7 million in the second quarter of 2026 increased from $12.1 million a year ago, primarily driven by higher incentive compensation accruals and $1.3 million in restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"Moving now to our increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q2","e":"npo","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"We are still not contemplating a significant improvement in commercial vehicle markets in our increased 2026 guidance ranges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/enpro-npo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q3","e":"npo","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"In Advanced Surface Technologies, demand associated with advanced semiconductor production continues to strengthen, and the investments we are making to position us to support our customers as they expand capacity for artificial intelligence, advanced computing, and communications infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/enpro-npo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q3","e":"npo","d":"2026-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Vaillancourt","x":"We expect our pricing actions along with some operational efficiencies, some other levers we can pull, so we won't have any meaningful impact in price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/enpro-npo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q3","e":"npo","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"We are pleased to report these strong results for the third quarter of 2026 and an increased outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/enpro-npo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NPO 2026 Q3","e":"npo","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Bruderek","x":"Moving now to our increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/enpro-npo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,10495,0,0,0,8843,1170],[37,1,7223,0,0,0,6219,633],[38,1,7551,0,0,0,6215,976],[39,1,8436,0,0,0,6571,1470],[40,1,7824,0,0,0,6557,942],[41,1,8218,0,0,0,7010,883],[42,1,6864,0,0,0,6053,568],[43,1,7168,0,0,0,6182,723],[44,1,7724,0,0,0,7001,494],[45,1,7249,0,0,0,6002,961],[46,1,5373,0,0,0,4549,560],[47,1,7091,0,0,0,5964,836],[48,1,4074,0,0,0,3409,433],[49,1,5612,0,0,0,4434,893],[50,1,3923,0,0,0,3205,488],[64,1,5224,0,0,0,4465,208],[65,1,3759,0,0,0,3408,185],[66,1,4662,0,0,0,3593,839],[67,1,4982,0,0,0,3727,830]],"cinema":[[36,1,10495,0,0,0,8843,1170],[37,1,7223,0,0,0,6219,633],[38,1,7551,0,0,0,6215,976],[39,1,8436,0,0,0,6571,1470],[40,1,7824,0,0,0,6557,942],[41,1,8218,0,0,0,7010,883],[42,1,6864,0,0,0,6053,568],[43,1,7168,0,0,0,6182,723],[44,1,7724,0,0,0,7001,494],[45,1,7249,0,0,0,6002,961],[46,1,5373,0,0,0,4549,560],[47,1,7091,0,0,0,5964,836],[48,1,4074,0,0,0,3409,433],[49,1,5612,0,0,0,4434,893],[50,1,3923,0,0,0,3205,488],[64,1,5224,0,0,0,4465,208],[65,1,3759,0,0,0,3408,185],[66,1,4662,0,0,0,3593,839],[67,1,4982,0,0,0,3727,830]],"imax":[[36,1,10495,0,0,0,8843,1170],[37,1,7223,0,0,0,6219,633],[38,1,7551,0,0,0,6215,976],[39,1,8436,0,0,0,6571,1470],[40,1,7824,0,0,0